      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:8",
      "text": "The boy jeers at them, pointing out that although they are many men, the assagais do not reach him but strike the ground.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:4"
      ]
