      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:10",
      "text": "The boy asks them to give him an assagai so that he may make a stab at them, but they refuse, saying they are not yet worsted.",
      "category": "speech",
      "evidence_refs": [
        "ev:5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "obs:11",
      "text": "They continue to hurl assagais at the boy; the weapons strike the ground and do not hit him.",
